trong kill of every earlier value of this/self). WI-tozar made the NESTED link (`x = this.b = v`) weak and left the statement level unchanged.\n\nNot checked: Rust (handler-based; see the Rust block-expression item), Go (no assignment expressions)."  # bb8b
